---
/*
 * The page a visitor gets when a link has gone stale.
 *
 * Until 2026-09-05 there was none, so an old or mistyped address landed on
 * GitHub\'s generic error page: a different typeface, a different colour, no
 * name, and no way back other than editing the address bar. On a CV that is
 * the worst possible moment to look like somebody else\'s site, because the
 * stale link is usually one Michael handed out himself.
 *
 * Deliberately NOT on BaseLayout. That layout emits a canonical URL, an
 * hreflang set and a Person object in JSON-LD, and every one of those is a
 * claim about a page that exists. This one does not exist by definition, so it
 * carries `noindex` and nothing else.
 *
 * Both languages, statically, no detection. GitHub Pages serves this one file
 * for /de/whatever and /en/whatever alike and tells the page nothing about
 * which was asked for, so guessing would be wrong half the time. Two short
 * lines cost less than a wrong guess, and they work with no JavaScript.
 */
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de" data-theme="system">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Seite nicht gefunden · Michael Boiman</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Diese Adresse gibt es nicht mehr. Zurück zum Lebenslauf von Michael Boiman, auf Deutsch oder Englisch." />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f8fbff" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0f172a" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" />
  <script is:inline>
    /* Same key and the same two values the toggle writes, so a visitor who
       chose light does not get a dark flash on the way to an error page. */
    (() => {
      try {
        const saved = localStorage.getItem('theme-choice');
        const choice = saved === 'light' || saved === 'dark' ? saved : 'system';
        const isDark = choice === 'dark'
          || (choice === 'system' && window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches);
        document.documentElement.dataset.theme = choice;
        document.documentElement.classList.toggle('dark', isDark);
      } catch {}
    })();
  </script>
  <style>
    .nf-wrap {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .nf-card { max-width: 34rem; width: 100%; }
    .nf-code {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }
    .nf-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    }
    .nf-lead { color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 1rem 0 0; }
    .nf-en { color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0.35rem 0 0; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
    .nf-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    .nf-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 2.75rem;              /* a tap target, not a word */
      padding: 0 1.125rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--surface);
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
    }
    .nf-link:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
    .nf-link-primary {
      background: var(--accent-cta);
      border-color: var(--accent-cta);
      color: #fff;
    }
    .nf-link-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); border-color: var(--accent-hover); color: #fff; }
    .nf-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="nf-wrap">
    <div class="nf-card">
      <p class="nf-code">Fehler 404</p>
      <h1 class="nf-title">Diese Seite gibt es nicht.</h1>
      <p class="nf-lead">
        Der Link ist alt, oder in der Adresse steckt ein Tippfehler. Der Lebenslauf
        selbst ist da, hier entlang:
      </p>
      <p class="nf-en">This page does not exist. The CV itself is right here.</p>
      <div class="nf-links">
        <a class="nf-link nf-link-primary" href="/de/">Lebenslauf auf Deutsch</a>
        <a class="nf-link" href="/en/">CV in English</a>
        <a class="nf-link" href="/de/story/">Projekt-Story</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
